<h2>Bacaan lebih lanjut</h2>
<ul>
<li>The Hidden Public: The Story of the Book-of-the-Month Club by Charles Lee (New York: Doubleday &amp; Company, 1958) provides a history of the club, the book selection and membership procedures, and a list of all selections, dividends, and alternates from 1926 to 1957.</li>
<li>The Books of the Century, a website compiled by Daniel Immerwahr (Northwestern University), lists the Club's main selections from 1926 until the mid-1970s.</li>
<li>Janice Radway, A Feeling for Books: The Book-of-the-Month Club, Literary Taste, and Middle-Class Desire (Chapel Hill, 1997) offers a cultural analysis of the BOMC and its readers.</li>
